  "details": "I use a wide aspect ratio adjusted via the config file.\nIn the previous camera, the image would extend to the sides. Though in the new camera, the image is fitted to the inner frame of the camera. Unfortunately, I'm now unable to properly see what's within the top and bottom of the frame.\nI suggest reading the config file upon start (or whenever) and adjusting the realtime render texture according to the user's input without stretching the image to the 16:9 model (leaving black bars on the top/bottom or sides).",
